---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import "../styles/global.css";
---

<Base
  title="Tools · paultendo"
  description="Open-source tools for Unicode security, namespace validation and brand protection by Paul Wood."
>
  <div class="shell tools-frame">
    <section class="tools-hero">
      <h1 class="display-type">Tools</h1>
      <p class="tools-intro">
        Open-source libraries and live tools for Unicode security, namespace validation and brand protection.
        Everything here is free to use and built in public.
      </p>
    </section>

    <div class="tools-grid">
      <a href="https://github.com/paultendo/namespace-guard" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="tool-card glass-card">
        <div class="tool-header">
          <div class="tool-name-row">
            <h2 class="tool-name display-type">namespace-guard</h2>
            <span class="tool-badge mono">npm</span>
          </div>
          <p class="tool-tagline">Multi-tenant namespace validation with anti-spoofing</p>
        </div>
        <p class="tool-desc">
          Solves the shared URL namespace problem. When <code>yourapp.com/:slug</code> could be a user, an org or a reserved route,
          namespace-guard checks all of those in one call. Parallel multi-table uniqueness, NFKC normalisation,
          homoglyph detection via two confusable maps (including 1,063 novel pairs), profanity filtering and conflict suggestions.
        </p>
        <div class="tool-stats">
          <div class="tool-stat">
            <span class="tool-stat-value display-type">9</span>
            <span class="tool-stat-label mono">ORM adapters</span>
          </div>
          <div class="tool-stat">
            <span class="tool-stat-value display-type">7</span>
            <span class="tool-stat-label mono">suggestion strategies</span>
          </div>
          <div class="tool-stat">
            <span class="tool-stat-value display-type">v0.20</span>
            <span class="tool-stat-label mono">latest</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="tool-links mono">
          <span>GitHub</span>
          <span>npm</span>
          <span>Docs</span>
        </div>
      </a>

      <a href="https://github.com/paultendo/confusable-vision" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="tool-card glass-card">
        <div class="tool-header">
          <div class="tool-name-row">
            <h2 class="tool-name display-type">confusable-vision</h2>
            <span class="tool-badge mono">research</span>
          </div>
          <p class="tool-tagline">Visual similarity scoring across Unicode codepoints</p>
        </div>
        <p class="tool-desc">
          Renders Unicode characters across system fonts and measures visual similarity.
          Current method (RaySpace) casts rays through glyph Bezier curves at 36 angles, producing
          per-font similarity scores without rendering a single pixel. Mathematically a discretised binary Radon transform.
        </p>
        <div class="tool-stats">
          <div class="tool-stat">
            <span class="tool-stat-value display-type">249K</span>
            <span class="tool-stat-label mono">confusable pairs</span>
          </div>
          <div class="tool-stat">
            <span class="tool-stat-value display-type">245</span>
            <span class="tool-stat-label mono">fonts scored</span>
          </div>
          <div class="tool-stat">
            <span class="tool-stat-value display-type">12</span>
            <span class="tool-stat-label mono">scripts</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="tool-links mono">
          <span>GitHub</span>
          <span>Research posts</span>
        </div>
      </a>

      <a href="https://d0ma1n.app" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="tool-card glass-card">
        <div class="tool-header">
          <div class="tool-name-row">
            <h2 class="tool-name display-type">d0ma1n</h2>
            <span class="tool-badge tool-badge--live mono">live</span>
          </div>
          <p class="tool-tagline">Find lookalike domains targeting your brand</p>
        </div>
        <p class="tool-desc">
          Enter a domain and get back every confusable variant: registered threats and unregistered opportunities.
          Built on confusable-vision's scored data (4,174 RaySpace-scored pairs across 12 scripts),
          deployed as a Cloudflare Worker with DNS resolution via DoH.
        </p>
        <div class="tool-stats">
          <div class="tool-stat">
            <span class="tool-stat-value display-type">4,174</span>
            <span class="tool-stat-label mono">scored pairs</span>
          </div>
          <div class="tool-stat">
            <span class="tool-stat-value display-type">DoH</span>
            <span class="tool-stat-label mono">DNS resolution</span>
          </div>
          <div class="tool-stat">
            <span class="tool-stat-value display-type">CF</span>
            <span class="tool-stat-label mono">Workers</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="tool-links mono">
          <span>Try it live</span>
          <span>GitHub</span>
        </div>
      </a>
    </div>

    <section class="tools-cta">
      <p class="tools-cta-text">
        These tools connect. namespace-guard consumes confusable-vision's data for homoglyph detection.
        d0ma1n uses namespace-guard for domain scanning.
        Read the <a href="/#unicode-security">research posts</a> for the full story.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  .tools-frame {
    max-width: var(--layout-frame-width);
    margin-inline: auto;
    padding-bottom: 4rem;
  }
  .tools-hero {
    padding-top: clamp(2rem, 6vh, 4rem);
    margin-bottom: clamp(2rem, 4vh, 3.5rem);
  }
  .tools-hero h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4.5vw, 3.5rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 0.95;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
  }
  .tools-intro {
    max-width: 48ch;
    color: var(--ink-muted);
    line-height: 1.7;
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }
  .tools-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }
  .tool-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding: clamp(1.5rem, 2.5vw, 2.25rem);
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
    transition: border-color 0.2s ease-out, transform 0.2s ease-out;
  }
  .tool-card:hover {
    border-color: rgba(30, 215, 96, 0.35);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .tool-card:hover .tool-name {
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  .tool-header {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.35rem;
  }
  .tool-name-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.65rem;
  }
  .tool-name {
    font-size: clamp(1.3rem, 2.2vw, 1.65rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.1;
    transition: color 0.2s ease-out;
  }
  .tool-badge {
    font-size: 0.6rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 0.15rem 0.5rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    color: var(--ink-muted);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .tool-badge--live {
    border-color: rgba(30, 215, 96, 0.4);
    color: var(--accent);
    background: rgba(30, 215, 96, 0.08);
  }
  .tool-tagline {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--ink-muted);
    line-height: 1.4;
  }
  .tool-desc {
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: var(--ink-muted);
    line-height: 1.65;
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }
  .tool-desc code {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.82em;
    padding: 0.1rem 0.35rem;
    border-radius: 0.3rem;
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    color: var(--foreground);
  }
  .tool-stats {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    padding-top: 0.5rem;
    padding-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }
  .tool-stat {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.15rem;
  }
  .tool-stat-value {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.1;
    color: var(--foreground);
  }
  .tool-stat-label {
    font-size: 0.62rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--ink-muted);
  }
  .tool-links {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--accent);
    margin-top: auto;
    padding-top: 0.5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .tools-cta {
    margin-top: 3rem;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .tools-cta-text {
    color: var(--ink-muted);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    max-width: 56ch;
    margin-inline: auto;
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }
  .tools-cta-text a {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .tools-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    }
  }
</style>
